# ===== ENV connectivity renders (DinoDigger-l9g) =====
# Tools/render_env_scene.py composes the REAL island out of Main.unity's cell data so the
# tile JOINS can be reviewed in context (verify sheets show tiles in isolation, which is
# how the connectivity bug got signed off in the first place). The per-view PNGs are big
# and reproducible in ~2s — only the stacked review sheet is worth keeping in the repo.
Tools/render/*
!Tools/render/connectivity_review.png
